# ============================================================================
# Vercel deploy ignore list (Security Sprint 8B Phase 1)
# ============================================================================
# These files are operator CLI utilities that should not be shipped to the
# Vercel runtime. They are not referenced by package.json scripts, vercel.json,
# .github/workflows, or any other runtime code. They contain hard-coded
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY usage and have no business in the deployed bundle.
#
# The scripts remain in the repository for operator use via local CLI.
# Do not delete them without checking with the operator first — some may
# still be referenced by historical runbooks.
# ============================================================================

